  (text "GND_H: header ground pins, tied to GND here." (at 12.7 121.92 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 44db53d2-1044-5db8-92c9-102997db94dc))
  (text "J701 pin -> STM32G474:\n 3 ADC_IN        PA0 ADC12_IN1\n 5 VREFP         VREF+ (VREFBUF 2.9 V)\n 7 DAC_TRIG      PA4 DAC1_OUT1\n 8 DAC_OFS       PA5 DAC1_OUT2\n 9 DAC_TAPTH     PA6 DAC2_OUT1\n10 DAC_BIAS_A    PA2 OPAMP1 (DAC3_CH1)\n11 DAC_BIAS_K    PB1 OPAMP3 (DAC3_CH2)\n13 ADC_TRIG      EXTI11 pin (ADC12 ext. trigger)\n14 MCU_CLK       PF0 OSC_IN (HSE bypass)\n16 TRIG_SEL      GPIO\n17 NC            spare, not connected\n18 FPGA_DONE     GPIO in\n19 FPGA_RECONFIG GPIO open-drain\n20 I2C_SCL       I2C SCL\n21 I2C_SDA       I2C SDA\n22 SPI_SCK       SPI SCK\n23 SPI_MOSI      SPI MOSI\n24 SPI_MISO      SPI MISO\n25 SPI_CS        SPI NSS / GPIO\n27 UC_SWDIO      PA13 SWDIO\n28 UC_SWCLK      PA14 SWCLK\n29 UC_NRST       NRST\n30 DBG1          GPIO (debug)\n31 HOST_RX       UART TX (host RX)\n32 HOST_TX       UART RX (host TX)\nGND: 1, 2, 4, 6, 12, 15, 26\n27-32 from the programming header J501 (yanartas sensing board J3 pinout).\nHOST_RX/HOST_TX: named as seen from the host (debug adapter),\nHOST_RX = MCU UART TX, HOST_TX = MCU UART RX." (at 12.7 129.54 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 9d9f7a36-fcf8-5711-a52d-1a013b802baf))
